<style>
  .features-wrap {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .feature {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 16px;
  }

  .feature-title {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    padding-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .feature-desc {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
</style>

<section class="section-wrap features" id="features">
  <h2 class="section-title">Features</h2>

  <div class="features-wrap">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">🗂 Date-based structure</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        Organizes files into YYYY/MM/ folders with correct modification times.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">📁 Album preservation</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        Keeps album folders intact under <code>albums/</code> without flattening your
        library.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">🔍 Broken JSON names</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        Matches <code>.suppl.json</code>, <code>.supplemen.json</code>, <code>.supplemental-met.json</code>, and more —
        including Windows-truncated paths.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">🪞 Duplicate detection</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        <strong>MD5</strong> hash check skips identical files and renames conflicting ones
        instead of overwriting.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">🏷 3-tier date fallback</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        JSON → EXIF (via Pillow) → filename pattern. If all fail, the file lands
        in <code>unknown_date/</code>.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">🔬 Dry-run mode</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        Preview exactly what would be copied before committing — no disk writes,
        no surprises.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">📦 Flat mode</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        <code>--flat</code> fixes dates in any photo folder, not just a Takeout export —
        handy after an SD card transfer scrambles your timestamps.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-title">💻 Cross-platform</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">
        <strong>gphotos-fixer</strong> is a CLI program that can run on Windows, macOS and Linux.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
